// A derivative operator inside a function whose parameter is a VECTOR. The
// companion carries the parameter's derivative along each spatial axis, so the
// tangent has the parameter's own shape. Packing it as one gradient and
// indexing it componentwise is only correct for a scalar parameter, and for a
// vector one produced a shape error.
shell(q) {
  d = length(q) - 1;
  return abs(d) / max(length(d.dp), 0.5);
}

return shell(p * 0.5) - 0.2;
